<http://data.silknow.org/object/ef0d56dd-0afc-3891-9832-8356add0ba83>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Brocade woven in silk and silver thread on a taffeta silk ground. The pattern consists of wavy band (in red) imitating lace, with roses in silver or green, white, and shades of red and blue. Between the bands is a repeating pattern of a man, cap in hand, offering a bouquet to a lady with a large parasol, behind whom a dog is standing on his hind legs. These figures are in colours and are shown standing on a silver ground. The ground of the brocade is salmon-coloured."@en , "Brocaded silk; Italy; 1760s"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/7f73683e-d2a9-335f-af25-24a14c994f60> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Brocaded silk; Italy; 1760s"@en , "Brocade woven in silk and silver thread on a taffeta silk ground. The pattern consists of wavy band (in red) imitating lace, with roses in silver or green, white, and shades of red and blue. Between the bands is a repeating pattern of a man, cap in hand, offering a bouquet to a lady with a large parasol, behind whom a dog is standing on his hind legs. These figures are in colours and are shown standing on a silver ground. The ground of the brocade is salmon-coloured."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/ef0d56dd-0afc-3891-9832-8356add0ba83/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/ef0d56dd-0afc-3891-9832-8356add0ba83/dimension/2> ;
